      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 1.14,
      "end_seconds": 2.72,
      "duration_seconds": 1.58,
      "text": "Evening. Let's get started."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 4.48,
      "end_seconds": 7.33,
      "duration_seconds": 2.85,
      "text": "Hello, thanks for fitting me in."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 9.16,
      "end_seconds": 11.64,
      "duration_seconds": 2.48,
      "text": "What do you need help with?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 12.9,
      "end_seconds": 18.09,
      "duration_seconds": 5.19,
      "text": "Doctor, it's yellow eyes. It's getting on my nerves now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 18.9,
      "end_seconds": 20.87,
      "duration_seconds": 1.97,
      "text": "Any regular medication at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 22.11,
      "end_seconds": 25.7,
      "duration_seconds": 3.59,
      "text": "No, uh, nothing at the moment."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 26.52,
      "end_seconds": 29.94,
      "duration_seconds": 3.42,
      "text": "Can you tell me when it first started?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 30.7,
      "end_seconds": 34.34,
      "duration_seconds": 3.64,
      "text": "It's been going on for two days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 51.33,
      "end_seconds": 55.84,
      "duration_seconds": 4.51,
      "text": "Have you had any fever, vomiting blood or itching?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 57.83,
      "end_seconds": 62.61,
      "duration_seconds": 4.78,
      "text": "No fever, vomiting blood or itching, none of it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 64.29,
      "end_seconds": 67.94,
      "duration_seconds": 3.65,
      "text": "Anything on the skin I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 69.89,
      "end_seconds": 71.86,
      "duration_seconds": 1.97,
      "text": "No, skin's been fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 72.45,
      "end_seconds": 74.98,
      "duration_seconds": 2.53,
      "text": "Alright, anything unusual with passing urine?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 76.85,
      "end_seconds": 78.29,
      "duration_seconds": 1.44,
      "text": "No changes there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 80.24,
      "end_seconds": 83.17,
      "duration_seconds": 2.93,
      "text": "Have you had any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 83.95,
      "end_seconds": 85.46,
      "duration_seconds": 1.51,
      "text": "No surgery, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 86.63,
      "end_seconds": 90.59,
      "duration_seconds": 3.96,
      "text": "Any medical conditions, anything you've been treated for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 91.5,
      "end_seconds": 93.74,
      "duration_seconds": 2.24,
      "text": "No, nothing at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 94.26,
      "end_seconds": 97.17,
      "duration_seconds": 2.91,
      "text": "A few questions about your lifestyle now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 98.38,
      "end_seconds": 109.07,
      "duration_seconds": 10.69,
      "text": "I hardly move around during the day. I work in accounts at a hospital. I grab fast food at lunch most days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 122.9,
      "end_seconds": 126.75,
      "duration_seconds": 3.85,
      "text": "Let me ask about allergies, anything at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 127.73,
      "end_seconds": 131.7,
      "duration_seconds": 3.97,
      "text": "No, nothing as far as I know."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 133.71,
      "end_seconds": 136.84,
      "duration_seconds": 3.13,
      "text": "Time for your numbers, if that's okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 145.97,
      "end_seconds": 148.54,
      "duration_seconds": 2.57,
      "text": "Okay, this won't take long..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 166.72,
      "end_seconds": 173.27,
      "duration_seconds": 6.55,
      "text": "Okay: temperature is 36.5 degrees, heart rate 69, blood pressure 118 over 82."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 174.37,
      "end_seconds": 175.95,
      "duration_seconds": 1.58,
      "text": "Is that okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 177.51,
      "end_seconds": 181.62,
      "duration_seconds": 4.11,
      "text": "They help me see the whole picture, more shortly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 183.12,
      "end_seconds": 187.01,
      "duration_seconds": 3.89,
      "text": "Let me look at the area, I'll be gentle."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 187.98,
      "end_seconds": 190.63,
      "duration_seconds": 2.65,
      "text": "So, I'm just checking this side."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 209.54,
      "end_seconds": 216.36,
      "duration_seconds": 6.82,
      "text": "The whites of your eyes are yellow and the liver edge is tender under the right ribs."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 221.38,
      "end_seconds": 224.82,
      "duration_seconds": 3.44,
      "text": "Right, thank you, you can get dressed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 238.0,
      "end_seconds": 255.63,
      "duration_seconds": 17.63,
      "text": "So where does that leave us? The most likely explanation is an acute viral hepatitis. Let me repeat that back to make sure. You've had yellow eyes for two days, and no itching or vomiting blood."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 257.23,
      "end_seconds": 258.86,
      "duration_seconds": 1.63,
      "text": "That's it, yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 275.7,
      "end_seconds": 283.99,
      "duration_seconds": 8.29,
      "text": "I want liver blood tests done, that's for jaundice. I'm going to order an ultrasound of the liver, for jaundice."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 285.21,
      "end_seconds": 286.69,
      "duration_seconds": 1.48,
      "text": "That makes sense."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 287.36,
      "end_seconds": 318.0,
      "duration_seconds": 30.64,
      "text": "No alcohol at all and avoid paracetamol and other painkillers unless we say. Try to keep a simple diary of when it happens and what you were doing, and bring it to the next visit. I'd like you to see the liver clinic as well, and I'll write the referral. Let's hold off on a hepatitis screen for now, and if there's no change in two weeks we can revisit it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 321.07,
      "end_seconds": 327.69,
      "duration_seconds": 6.62,
      "text": "Please come and see me in one week. Anything else on your mind before you go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 329.03,
      "end_seconds": 332.4,
      "duration_seconds": 3.37,
      "text": "No, that's all. Thanks a lot."
    }
  ]
}